**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/blob-report
**/playwright/.cache

# Segredos e ambiente local
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example

# Fora do escopo das imagens
.git
.github
apps/mobile
prototypes
docs
terminals
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
